# Working notes for whoever picks the branch up next. Local only — it is scratch
# for development, not part of the recipe book.
handoff.md

# Recipe ingestion staging (see AGENTS.md → Recipe ingestion).
# The directory skeleton is committed; the contents never are. Sources under raw/
# and processed/ are frequently other people's copyrighted material and this repo
# is public, and markdown/ holds unreviewed proposals that are transient by design.
input_recipes/*/*
!input_recipes/*/.gitkeep
